deliverable 2). GENERATED by `results/zk60_lean_l58_20261110/l58_mk_inc.py` from lane L52's `eb_inc_opXG`
(RunEpBInc.lean, itself L48's `rs_inc_opXG` under repair B).

* **`ex_inc_opXG`**: at an accepted run (stage IN-C at part `i`, any code geometry whose numbers the endpoint verifier
  has), the closing opening read off the bytes meets `RhOpWC`, the witness of `RhOpWM` it builds with the CHECKED
  extraction at ITS opening and root, as soon as both extractions (`RhXOkM`, `RhXOkC`) hold at the statement's input
